        "Content": "Leonard Wilson Keenan \r\n\r\nOur Business is you. \r\n\r\n2 Bedroom 2 Bathroom Mid terrace \r\n\r\nOff Steet Parking \r\n\r\nRichard Todd and Leonard Wilson Keenan are delighted to present 10 Dun Saithne Green To the North County Dublin property market.\r\n\r\n10 Dun Saithne Green is a well-presented two-bedroom, two-bathroom mid-terrace home ideally situated in a quiet cul-de-sac within the popular Dun Saithne development in Balbriggan. The property benefits from off-street parking and enjoys a pleasant position overlooking a large green area, making it an ideal setting for families, children to play or simply relaxing outdoors.\r\n\r\nOn arrival, the property is presented with an attractive red-brick façade, creating an inviting first impression. On entering, you are greeted by a bright and welcoming hallway which leads through to the accommodation. To the right is the spacious front living room, providing a comfortable and cosy space for relaxing and entertaining. Continuing through the property, there is a convenient downstairs WC before progressing into the bright and well-proportioned open-plan kitchen and dining area. The kitchen is fitted with an excellent range of base and eye-level units, providing ample storage and workspace. The dining area overlooks the rear garden, with access leading directly outside, creating a lovely flow between the indoor and outdoor living spaces.\r\n\r\nThe rear garden is a particularly attractive feature of the property, providing a private outdoor space which is ideal for entertaining, family gatherings, outdoor dining or simply enjoying some fresh air during the warmer months. The generous green area to the front of the property further enhances the family-friendly setting.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are two spacious double bedrooms, both offering comfortable and versatile accommodation, along with a family bathroom. The property provides well-balanced accommodation throughout and would make an ideal home for first-time buyers, couples, small families or investors.\r\n\r\nThe location is another major attraction, with a host of amenities close by. Balbriggan is a popular coastal town in North County Dublin and offers a wide selection of local shops, cafés, restaurants and everyday services. Millfield Shopping Centre is also nearby and provides a range of retail, dining and leisure facilities. The area is well served by a selection of primary and secondary schools, making it a convenient location for families with children.\r\n\r\nFor commuters, Balbriggan benefits from excellent transport links, including Balbriggan railway station, which provides regular services towards Dublin and Dundalk. There are also a number of bus services operating through the town, providing convenient connections to Dublin and surrounding areas. The M1 motorway is easily accessible, offering straightforward access to Dublin Airport, Dublin City and the wider North County Dublin area.\r\n\r\nOverall, 10 Dun Saithne Green presents an excellent opportunity to acquire a comfortable and well-located two-bedroom home in a peaceful residential setting. With its off-street parking, spacious living accommodation, open-plan kitchen and dining area, private rear garden and attractive position overlooking a large green space, this property is sure to appeal to a wide range of purchasers. Viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate what this lovely home has to offer.\r\n\r\n\r\nWe are a proud affiliate of Keller Williams, the worlds largest property brand with excess of 180,000 agents worldwide working together to source a buyer for your property.\r\n\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
